WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.490
Just as I like admiring the natural art of the universe

2
00:00:06.490 --> 00:00:12.440
in the photos of space, I like doing the same with human

3
00:00:12.440 --> 00:00:13.000
art.

4
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:19.330
This is a set of paintings I love that goes with my

5
00:00:19.330 --> 00:00:24.000
style and I would hang them in my home.

6
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:29.730
If you look closely each of these paintings could become

7
00:00:29.730 --> 00:00:37.720
a whole film or a series of films and well they are

8
00:00:37.720 --> 00:00:41.000
paintings that are poems at the same time.

9
00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:47.660
Most are by similar painters because I like keeping them

10
00:00:47.660 --> 00:00:51.000
on the same track so to speak.

11
00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:54.480
Once again they have no ranking,

12
00:00:54.480 --> 00:00:56.000
I like them all.

13
00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:03.500
They are like so different but yet so alike and I wanted

14
00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:06.418
to share them here too.
